  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EU TAIEX Kosovo, Lantm&#xE4;teriet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU TAIEX, Kosovo, Lantm&#xE4;teriet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sidas st&#xF6;d inom detta beslut avser Lantm&#xE4;teriets kostnader f&#xF6;r planering av TAIEX studiebes&#xF6;k till Sverige. Lantm&#xE4;teriet i Sverige har beslutat att anta TAIEX beg&#xE4;ran fr&#xE5;n EC med anledning av projektet i Kosovo, &quot;Valuation for Expropriation and Valuation in General&quot;. Projektet finansieras av IPA med beteckningen KOS IND/STUD 46556.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sidas support within this decision regards Lantm&#xE4;teriets costs for the planning of TAIEX study visit to Sweden. Lantm&#xE4;teriet in Sweden has decided to accept a TAIEX request from the EC due to the project in Kosoco named &quot;Valuation for Expropriation and Valuation in General&quot;. The project is financed by IPA with the denomination KOS IND/STUD 46556.</narrative>
  </description>
